    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by \"letting go of the pressure\"? like i've tried everything to just exist peacefully and it never works. it just feels like the only way to actually stop the heavy feeling is to just stop everything. like, is there even a version of this where it's not just more of the same?",
